      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T20:39:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see any checks in `pdc_dpm_eval_sink_fixed_pdo()` for the battery overload condition.\n\nI think this scenario will stiff offer 3A to a newly connected device:\n1. User a SNK device that only needs 1.5A\n2. Battery power/current exceeds limit due to high CPU load\n3. EC throttles sourcing to 1.5A on all ports\n4. User connects a second SNK device that wants 3A.\n5. DPM runs, sees that no devices are currently sinking 3A, so DPM offers 3A to the new device.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 513,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 513,
        "endChar": 50
